  "no_colors_cause": "The palette is loaded only through the runtime string /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary.DA_Primary, which does not establish a cook dependency. With bCookAll=False and no explicit palette directory inclusion, the package is absent from the packaged build. The log reports the missing package, failed palette lookup, and fallback gray. Fixed by adding /Game/Data/Palettes to DirectoriesToAlwaysCook in the packaging settings.",
  "assumptions": [
    "The supplied packaged log represents the reported failures.",
    "The palette asset exists at the specified path in the full project, consistent with the editor working.",
    "The supplied source excerpt reflects the packaged build's ownership and loading behavior."
  ],
